Dialogue: 4,0:02:31.79,0:02:34.14,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}Only I know the truth
Dialogue: 4,0:02:34.14,0:02:36.49,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}僕だけが僕を知ってんの
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.49,0:02:41.14,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}お前を　守り抜き
Dialogue: 4,0:02:41.14,0:02:45.99,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}側に居よう　救いたい
Dialogue: 4,0:02:45.99,0:02:47.89,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}剥き出しの焦燥
Dialogue: 4,0:02:47.89,0:02:50.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}冷静を貫いた
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.54,0:02:52.89,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}Only I know the truth
Dialogue: 4,0:02:52.89,0:02:55.79,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}僕だけが僕を知ってんだから
